  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen trying to switch into a Local Avatar Test Build you will be in it for like a second and then you are going to be switched back to the Avatar you used before.\n\nThis makes it impossible to test Avatars on g-test.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nSwitching into a Local Avatar Test Build should not instantly put you back into the Avatar you used before.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/lf14k8.mp4",
